This MIT licence covers ghOSt's own work: the build orchestration, rootfs stages,
overlay configuration, launcher, stealth daemon, documents and tests.

Two groups of files are not MIT:

* Files derived from handtop (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Handtop contributors) keep
