* Files derived from rg35xxh-cyberdeck (GPL-2.0, Copyright (C) 2026 hataketsu
  (Arne Muco) and contributors) are distributed under GPL-2.0; the full text is
  in LICENSES/GPL-2.0.txt. Each such file says so in its header.

See NOTICE for every third-party source, what was used and under which licence.
The MIT notice above does not replace those notices for the files they cover.
Because MIT is compatible with the GPL, distributing this source tree as a whole
satisfies both.
